# Ling 3.0 Flash Sante — findings by MiniMax M3.1 Flash

> SELF-EXCLUDED REPORT — no scored findings file is provided for this model.
> "Ling 3.0 Flash Sante" is a real **API-only hosted** specialization of Ling 3.0
> Flash (Ant Group, health/medical), but it has **no public weights, no public model
> card, no public licence and no verified benchmark numbers**. Per the project
> template (`model-report-TEMPLATE.md`, "SELF-EXCLUSION") this file is saved as
